    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/7e778dc108e914738b2116b52c29c134.webp?t=1752240277\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monday Syndrome is a singleplayer action roguelike where you play as an intern that's trapped in a hellish office.\u00a0Descend into a satirical corporate hell, battling demonic coworkers with absurd office supply weapons in an endless, procedurally generated tower. Can you survive the eternal 9-to-5?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/15dac07af982bd391917e0194f2cafab.webp?t=1752240277\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/d02d8364bc1c29c60e060edbdb2d4d59.poster.avif?t=1752240277\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/d02d8364bc1c29c60e060edbdb2d4d59.webm?t=1752240277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/d02d8364bc1c29c60e060edbdb2d4d59.mp4?t=1752240277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash fast-paced, chaotic combat amidst destructible office environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/64a617ce81dd8a1199cb5734f35284ea.webp?t=1752240277\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/c307049880c51cc137825db75a74bf6c.poster.avif?t=1752240277\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/c307049880c51cc137825db75a74bf6c.webm?t=1752240277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/c307049880c51cc137825db75a74bf6c.mp4?t=1752240277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine mundane office supplies to craft absurdly deadly tools of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/fa32f5700996675e365a0da4350721ec.webp?t=1752240277\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/1dc450c64b189e324c836a1a1865eb69.poster.avif?t=1752240277\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/1dc450c64b189e324c836a1a1865eb69.webm?t=1752240277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/1dc450c64b189e324c836a1a1865eb69.mp4?t=1752240277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure intrusive Executive Orders, powerful boons with chaotic distruptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/0084fd0140dc1165763e9c7fa6a7f595.webp?t=1752240277\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/8f565bb817a80d8bdc29afad49ff167a.poster.avif?t=1752240277\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/8f565bb817a80d8bdc29afad49ff167a.webm?t=1752240277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/8f565bb817a80d8bdc29afad49ff167a.mp4?t=1752240277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your profession and work towards being the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/d2086a2b22e752d9bc482b89692b120b.webp?t=1752240277\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtesters said &quot;damn this game is so addictive I can't stop playing&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monday Syndrome is a game that's evolving through the development. That's the reason trailer doesn't match these gifs. The gifs are the up-to-date look. I'll update the trailer soon\u2122</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to join Discord (by clicking the link on the side panel!)</p>",
